CVPR,cs_conf,generative,Xing_Dual-Granularity_Semantic_Guided_Sparse_Routing_Diffusion_Model_f,1,concept|map,1,0,"Motivation behind SGDiff, where (a) presents distinct scenes (Building and Agriculture) captured by the identical satellite (GF-2), and (b) depicts the same scene observed from different satellites. Both scenarios can lead the model trained on a single satellite dataset to overly rely on specific sensors and scenes. (c) Grounding description from GeoChat, which emphasizes object grounding and spatial relationships, providing useful region-level a priori information for pansharpening. will degrade in river scenes. A feasible solution is grouping these training samples to build multiple models."
