CVPR,cs_conf,perception2d,Zhang_Validating_Privacy-Preserving_Face_Recognition_under_a_Minimum_A,5,ablation,0,0,"Visual comparisons on the influence of modules PSC and REI. Map2V with PSC and REI modules can achieve a higher degree of similarity to the target faces. Table 4. Ablation study on PSC and REI of Map2V. Module Same system Different system PSC REI × × 97.34 79.82 ✓ × 97.55 75.72 × ✓ 97.38 84.57 ✓ ✓ 97.46 84.89 4.3. Ablation study Assessing the impact of the PSC and REI modules on privacy validation results, we analyzed the PSI of Map2V with and without each module on DuetFace, using the LFW dataset. Other parameters align with the 1k1c scenario. Effectiveness of PSC. Efficiently aligning recon-"
