NeurIPS,cs_conf,generative,DiffGS_Functional_Gaussian_Splatting_Diffusion__41fb2ecb5b7d1b505bca78,6,concept|qualitative,0,0,"Visualization of Point-to-Gaussian fittings on Deepfashion3D and generations on ShapeNet. partial 3DGS which contains large occlusions. In real-world applications, having only sparse views with limited viewpoint movement available for optimizing 3DGS often results in a partial 3DGS. Solving Gaussian Splatting completion task enables us to infer the complete and dense 3DGS from the partial ones for improving the rendering quality at invisible viewpoints. We introduce DiffGS with partial 3DGS as the conditions for solving this task. Specifically, we simply leverage a modified PointNet [50] as th"
