NeurIPS,cs_conf,other,T2I-R1_Reinforcing_Image_Generation_with_Collaborative_Semantic-level_,1,unclassified,0,0,"The Illustration of CoT in Image Understand and Generation Tasks. In the image understanding task, the CoT is the textual reasoning process. In the autoregressive visual generation task, we identify two levels of CoT: the semantic-level and token-level CoT. The semantic-level CoT is the high-level planning prior to the image generation, in the form of text. The token-level CoT is the intermediate patch-by-patch generation process, focusing on the local pixel details within a patch, in the form of image tokens. Despite these advances, the exploration of CoT for image generation remains prelimin"
