ICML,cs_conf,perception3d,A_Linear_Time_and_Space_Local_Point_Cloud_Geometry_Encoder_via_Vectori,4,overview|concept,0,0,"VecKM can be seamlessly integrated into deep point cloud architectures, improving both accuracy and efficiency. into deep point cloud architectures, which are capable of solving many tasks involving point cloud inputs. Appendix B gives the elegant implementation of VecKM in PyTorch. 4. Experiments We present extensive experiments to evaluate our VecKM encoding. In Section 4.1, we present quantitative and quali- tative analyses on the effectiveness, efficiency, robustness, and scalability of the proposed VecKM encoding by solving the low-level task of normal estimation. In Section 4.2-4.4, we d"
