AAAI,cs_conf,ml_methods,Relation-Aware_Equivariant_Graph_Networks_for_Epitope-Unknown_Antibody,4,curves,0,0,"Each RA-EGN layer aggregates messages and jointly updates features, coordinates, and relations. (2) Edge Relation Updating. Previous methods (Kong, Huang, and Liu 2022, 2023) mostly condition on pre-given epitopes and then consider only static interactions between known epitopes and antibodies. However, as different an- tibody CDRs are generated during training, the antigen- antibody interactions should also evolve dynamically. To achieve this, we transform antigen-antibody interaction dy- namics modeling as an edge relation optimization problem. 897"
