TPAMI,cs_journal,other,W7131248305,7,qualitative,1,0,Qualitative results. Results on all scenes from the MipNeRF-360 dataset [71]. This dataset shows complex real scenes with a complete 360 rotation on all scenes. We show several examples of single and multiple color editions. The first column is the original image. The second column is the edit performed by the user and used to train VIRGi. We also show the soft segmentation predicted by VIRGi for each recolored image.
