NatCommun,nature,life_sciences,W4392883115,7,clinical,0,0,"Proposed mechanism for NUDT1-dependent survival in MYC-driven tumor cells. MYC orchestrates the balance of two metabolic pathways that act in parallel, the NOX4-ROS pathway and the PLK1-NUDT1 nucleotide-sanitizing pathway. LC-1-40, which degrades NUDT1, disrupts the metabolic balance and eli- cits MYC-driven tumor cell death. See text for more details. Article https://doi.org/10.1038/s41467-024-46572-6 Nature Communications|   (2024) 15:2377 12"
