NatBiomedEng,nature,medical,W4362458937,6,concept,0,0,"ViT feature extractor places the highest importance on instrument tips, needles and anatomical edges. We present two sample RGB video frames of the needle handling activity and the corresponding spatial attention placed by ViT on patches of these frames."
